{#- The "How it runs" illustration: a house that gets built as you scroll
    through the five stages. Generated once by a script (the brick courses
    are a lot of rects); edit by hand if you like, the classes are what
    matter. Each group is shown by a .s-N class on the section:
      s-1 the call        pegs and string line on the plot, phone ringing
      s-2 site visit      tape measure across the plot, foundations poured
      s-3 planned+priced  the house drawn out in dashes, the quote arrives
      s-4 on site         walls rise course by course, windows, roof
      s-5 signed off      door on, lights on, the drawing lines go, a tick
    Motion is transform and opacity only. Decorative: aria-hidden. -#}
